# Fixture/dev artifacts must never be committed as if they were real data.
# Real deliverables are force-added explicitly once generated from the
# Kaggle dump (see README "Regenerate everything from raw data").
data/threads.jsonl
data/golden_unlabelled.jsonl
data/preds_*.jsonl
data/judgements.jsonl

# threads.jsonl is 43MB and the reproduction path never reads it
# (run_eval/validate_judge need only golden + preds + judgements).
# A 300-thread sample is committed for inspection instead.
!data/threads.sample.jsonl
